# Words of ours for US English's main volume: a word here is matched as the
# whole token it is written as, capitals and all, so Qt here is not qt and
# MATE is not mate. One a line, the word, a tab, and what is said in its
# place; tools/module/builtindict.py reads it after the community's, so an
# entry here replaces theirs. docs/language.md says how to add one.

# Typesetting
TeX	`[.1tEk]
LaTeX	`[.1le.2tEk]
BibTeX	`[.1bIb.2tEk]

# Systems, desktops and the programs on them
MacOS	mac O S
openSUSE	`[.2o.0pxn.1su.0zx]
FreeDOS	free `[.1das]
DOS	`[.1das]
Qt	cute
LXQt	L X cute
GNOME	`[.0gx.1nom]
MATE	`[.1ma.0te]
Xfce	X F C E
Xorg	X org
Xwayland	X wayland
HAProxy	H A proxy
Kdenlive	`[.2ke.0dEn.1lYv]
ROCm	`[.1rak.0xm]
CUDA	`[.1ku.0dx]

