# Units, which IBM's abbreviation dictionary would expand and which is off
Hz	hertz
kHz	kilohertz
MHz	megahertz
GHz	gigahertz
mAh	milliamp hours
Wh	watt hours
kWh	kilowatt hours
KiB	kibibytes
MiB	mebibytes
GiB	`[.1gI.0bX.2bYts]
TiB	tebibytes
kbps	kilobits per second
Mbps	megabits per second
Gbps	gigabits per second
ms	milliseconds

